{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>重返中環!巨型層層疊波士頓雪糕</p><p>Emack &amp; Bolio’s中環重開！</p><p>來自美國的人氣雪糕店Emack &amp; Bolio’s於2015年開設香港第1間分店，曾一度掀起熱潮，後來於2021年全線撤出香港。最近官方宣佈今年 9 月初將重返香港市場，並且再度重回舊地選址中環，大家又可以食經典巨型層層疊波士頓雪糕啦！</p><p>曾經風靡全城美式雪糕店！</p><p>這間來自美國波士頓的Emack &amp; Bolio’s雪糕店，於2015年首度登港，售賣以獨特脆筒盛載的美式雪糕、美式奶昔、朱古力及蛋糕等。誇張又重料的雪糕脆筒，加上層層疊疊的雪糕球，曾經風靡全城，門外的人龍佔滿半條鈄路，人人拿著誇張雪糕山，十分壯觀！</p><p>口味多達100款！</p><p>店家標榜雪糕以無添加及無激素牛奶製作而成，口味多達100款。而最IGable當然是超夢幻脆筒，例如棉花糖拔絲脆筒，可可脆棉花糖絲脆筒等，加上層層疊疊高達四球的雪糕山，就算未放雪糕造型已經十級誇張！</p><p>Emack &amp; Bolio’s 地址：中環蘇豪荷李活道47號 官方IG：@emackandbolioshkcentral</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178849444225463757_8533243166a9a426af0a97.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178849444460135562_5600449886a9a426d2972e.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178849444759828740_14969054286a9a4270046d6.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178849444954224157_18458582956a9a4271dd65e.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178849445198939329_1741680736a9a42745d580.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178849445370833697_9187765296a9a42762ca41.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178849445622233457_18528236646a9a427959d61.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178849445978678721_8275312506a9a427c42848.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178849446214817203_13392127086a9a42800424d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-04T04:20:25.637064+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":540,"images":9,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}